{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/javascript/ios_input_focus_buffer/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/324840d86766a513ee35133391bc4fec/ca1dc/image01.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 24.479166666666668%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/324840d86766a513ee35133391bc4fec/a59e9/image01.webp 192w,\n/static/324840d86766a513ee35133391bc4fec/0ca9f/image01.webp 384w,\n/static/324840d86766a513ee35133391bc4fec/4c79d/image01.webp 680w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/324840d86766a513ee35133391bc4fec/3b721/image01.png 192w,\n/static/324840d86766a513ee35133391bc4fec/66595/image01.png 384w,\n/static/324840d86766a513ee35133391bc4fec/ca1dc/image01.png 680w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/324840d86766a513ee35133391bc4fec/ca1dc/image01.png\"\n            alt=\"alt text\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span>\r\n<em>‘오늘날씨’ 입력</em></p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 678px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/49055fa813c9312dffa068f9b5e995a8/dc057/image02.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 23.4375%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAAFCAYAAABFA8wzAAAACXBIWXMAAAsTAAALEwEAmpwYAAAAj0lEQVR42qWPSxKCMBAFc//LuXKhxAWfYFACAhJJMGlTnAB1qrrmLV5N9YjTOSMvSsqqIpNy2957fh0hZU1ZGoqi5ZJypQzD6LE2Ms9hF9YGXqnvXETUasK0C8+JRGQcIo/+Td/tp707tJ5RyiEOx5yuHzfdEAIxfv/msnimZHSt08FGr9waT6P/5OrpzMoHcZ2Bx0q8nTYAAAAASUVORK5CYII='); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/49055fa813c9312dffa068f9b5e995a8/a59e9/image02.webp 192w,\n/static/49055fa813c9312dffa068f9b5e995a8/0ca9f/image02.webp 384w,\n/static/49055fa813c9312dffa068f9b5e995a8/e0546/image02.webp 678w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 678px) 100vw, 678px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/49055fa813c9312dffa068f9b5e995a8/3b721/image02.png 192w,\n/static/49055fa813c9312dffa068f9b5e995a8/66595/image02.png 384w,\n/static/49055fa813c9312dffa068f9b5e995a8/dc057/image02.png 678w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 678px) 100vw, 678px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/49055fa813c9312dffa068f9b5e995a8/dc057/image02.png\"\n            alt=\"alt text\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span>\r\n<em>value 삭제 후 ‘내일날씨’ 입력을 위해 ‘ㄴ’ 입력 (‘씨’ 가 buffer로 자동입력)</em></p>\n<p>한글은 자음, 모음으로 구성된다.</p>\n<p>iOS에서 input 에 있는 value를 ‘X’ 버튼 등으로 한번에 삭제하고 다시 input에 focus를 주려고 할 때,<br>\ninput에 입력되어 있던 문자가 한글이고, 마지막 문자가 받침이 없는 문자였다면,<br>\n문자를 재입력 했을 때 남아있던 버퍼가 함께 보여지게 된다.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>‘오늘날씨’ 입력 후</li>\n<li>X 버튼 클릭응로 value 삭제</li>\n<li>input에 focus가 옮겨지고 ‘내일날씨’를 입력</li>\n</ol>\n<p>이런 경우에 input value에는 ‘내일날씨’가 입력되어 있는게 아니라, 남아있던 buffer로 인해 ‘씨내일날씨’가 입력되게 된다.</p>\n<p>이 문제는, input에 focus를 주기 전, 다른 input을 생성해 그곳에 먼저 focus를 줬다가, 검색 input에 다시 focus를 줘서 buffer를 삭제해줘야 한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> hiddenInp <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> document<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">createElement</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'input'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        \r\nhiddenInp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">setAttribute</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'type'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'text'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\t<span class=\"token comment\">// 숨겨진 input (CSS 등 으로 숨긴다)</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>doc<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>body<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">prepend</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>hiddenInp<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\nhiddenInp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">focus</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\t<span class=\"token comment\">// focus</span>\r\n\r\nwindow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">setTimeout</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>inp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>nativeElement<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">focus</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  hiddenInp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">remove</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<br>\n<h5>참고</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://ggodong.tistory.com/294\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">iOS 한글 buffer 문제</a></li>\n</ul>","tableOfContents":"","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 6, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"iOS input focus, buffer","summary":"한글은 자음, 모음으로 구성된다. iOS에서 input 에 있는 value를 X 버튼 등으로 한번에 삭제하고 다시 input에 focus를 주려고 할 때, input에 입력되어 있던 문자가 한글이고, 마지막 문자가 받침이 없는 문자였다면, 문자를 재입력 했을 때 남아있던 버퍼가 함께 보여지게 된다.","date":"Jun 12, 2024","categories":["JavaScript"],"tags":[""],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/javascript/ios_input_focus_buffer/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/javascript/images_loaded/","title":"images Loaded"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/javascript/history_api/","title":"history API로 SPA 구현"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}